ded.\n\nConfidence and forum: the disputed value is 5.00 SGD, below POL-GEN-22's 10.00 SGD band; there is no safety flag (POL-GEN-21); and neither profile carries fraud_flags (driver 0, rider none), so the 0.95 uplift is not engaged. POL-NS-26 makes this no-show ruling final. The deciding fact — that no in-app call was placed — is carried by two weight-1.0 artifacts, EV-TRIP-06053 and EV-CHAT-06053, so confidence 0.90 sits within the cap. The absent artifact EV-ADVIS-06053-01 (TRAFFIC_ADVISORY, MISSING_ARTIFACT, weight 0.0) carries no fact any no-show clause uses, so POL-GEN-26 raises no open question here.\n\nNo referral fires: the fee is exactly 5.00 SGD, so the POL-NS-22 fee-amount referral does not apply; POL-NS-24's goodwill credit does not apply because the driver arrived at 19:47:40, well before any scheduled deadline; and POL-NS-25's repeat no-show counter is absent from the rider profile."
